- Produces skill-specific evidence.

F. Interview Agent
- Conducts mock interviews.
- Identifies strengths and weaknesses.

G. Progress and Adaptation Agent
- Analyzes course completion, quiz scores, interview feedback, and repeated errors.
- Determines whether the learning path should change.
- Recommends the next learning activity.
- Records the reason for each recommendation.

Implement a central orchestrator to coordinate these modules.

The system should follow this workflow:

Learner Profile
      ↓
Target Role Selection
      ↓
Skill Gap Analysis
      ↓
Personalized Learning Path
      ↓
RAG Chatbot + Courses
      ↓
MCQ Assessment + AI Interview
      ↓
Performance Analysis
      ↓
Adaptive Recommendation Engine
      ↓
